{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAEMDALE</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where every decision shapes the fate of your growing city. As you construct new buildings, you'll unlock powerful cards that define your strategy. Carefully chosen <strong>state policies</strong> offer deeper synergy with your deck, enabling new combinations.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/playing-librarian.gif?t=1747846765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Increase your Prestige</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While building your deck, you must defend your city against relentless <strong>raids</strong> and withstand disruptive <strong>revolutions</strong> that will demolish your deck if they are not prepared for. Manage these challenges to make sure you are prepared to build the critical <strong>prestige</strong> buildings to establish a true empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/unlocking-royal-court-exended.gif?t=1747846765\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf 50+ cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f 40+ buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc 20+ state policies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 10+ revolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f 4 difficulty levels</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720630?t=1747846765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/bd2e51837712be6c93843691d8de6bec75cdabf0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747846765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/03fe225083e3397cb39d49fe2540ac6cfad258a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17478467